.TH fujicli-device 1  "device "
.SH NAME
fujicli\-device \- Manage devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfujicli device\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage devices
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log extra debugging information (multiple instances increase verbosity)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
fujicli\-device\-list(1)
List cameras
.TP
fujicli\-device\-info(1)
Get camera info
